  "sql": "SELECT p.ProductName,\n       sumIf(f.SalesAmount, toMonth(f.DateKey) <= 6) AS H1Sales,\n       sumIf(f.SalesAmount, toMonth(f.DateKey) >= 7) AS H2Sales,\n       H2Sales - H1Sales AS Diff,\n       if(H1Sales = 0, NULL, H2Sales / H1Sales) AS Ratio\nFROM retail.FactSales AS f\nINNER JOIN retail.DimProduct AS p ON f.ProductKey = p.ProductKey\nWHERE toYear(f.DateKey) = 2009\nGROUP BY p.ProductName\nHAVING H1Sales > 0 AND H2Sales > H1Sales\nORDER BY Diff DESC\nLIMIT 20",
